app/data/

# Build artifacts
# v21.1.0 CHANGE (Phase-1.2): app/dist ab git me TRACK NAHI hota.
# Purane v21.0.1 rationale (fresh frontend on pull) ab build-pipeline se
# poori tarah serve hota hai:
#   1) supervisor.js ensureFrontend — dist missing/stale pe auto install+build
#   2) Render build command: npm ci && npm run build (README documented)
#   3) CI har push pe npm run check (build included) run karti hai
# Fayda: 40+ hashed dist files ka per-commit noise khatam, repo chhota,
# aur stale bundle kabhi serve nahi hota (boot stamp-warning + 503 self-heal).
app/dist/
build/
**/build/

# ml-service / deploy artifacts (agar kahin build hue)
ml-service/dist/

